<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 100,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 100,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's est 100,000, Wk ago 105,000, Yr ago 96,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were steady with mid-session Tuesday. Trade was moderately slow for moderate demand and light offerings. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
